<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Additional Figures</h2>

<figure id="A6.F7" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.08482v1/figures/plot3_transparency.png" id="A6.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:238/199;" width="238" height="199" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Correctly guessed signs from sign video only (&gt;3 models) in the Transparency<sub id="A6.F7.3" class="ltx_sub">2</sub> Task.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.08482v1/figures/fig2.png" id="A6.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:238/215;" width="238" height="215" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Zero-shot accuracy of the top 6 performing models (3 open, 3 closed) across five phonological features, averaged over 96 signs. Solid colored lines are models; black dashed and grey dotted are the human non-expert and random baselines, respectively.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</article>
